om that successful run and matches every module.\nNo formal failure, counterexample or formal fix attempt occurred.\n\nFinal expanded cocotb suite PASSED: eight pytest runners in 78.95 seconds,\nincluding the complete real pipeline suite, YOSYS-storage pipeline suite,\nALTOPS operand-capture\n…[1031 of 4103 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:cd27af039d7a0664]…\nhad no effect on the measured timed\nnetlist (the repeated options remained 88.252/87.121/87.121), so the final\nRTL preserves that existing source-reporting mechanism and its completed\nformal proof. The worst median-placement paths are in the unchanged\ndivider recurrence; the EX-result-to-ID capture path also appears among\nthe worst paths. No arithmetic, hazard schedule, formal gate or threshold\nwas changed to improve the reported result.\n\nConfidence in achieving the predicted fitness gain is low. ALTOPS formal\nchecks prove routing/control, not real M arithmetic; real arithmetic RTL\nis unchanged and covered by the existing real arithmetic tests/cosim.\nThe slow formal-deep arithmetic suite was not run. Correctness gates pass;\nthe hypothesis's performance acceptance threshold is not achieved.\n M cores/bench/rtl/core.sv\n M cores/bench/rtl/core_pkg.sv\n M cores/bench/rtl/ex_stage.sv\n M cores/bench/rtl/hazard_unit.sv\n M cores/bench/rtl/id_stage.sv\n M cores/bench/rtl/mem_stage.sv\n M cores/bench/test/test_pipeline.py\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
