correctly predicted transfers, forwarded\nand loaded branch/JALR operands, sign boundaries, reserved branch\nencodings, and taken/untaken misaligned targets. Exercise independent\ninstruction/data stalls around recovery and assert matching retired\nPCs, RVFI operands/order, and suppression of wrong-path side effects.\nDo not assert a particular inactive redirect_target value.\n'''}]\np.write_text(yaml.safe_dump(d,sort_keys=False, width=90))\njsonschema.validate(d,json.loads(Path('schemas/hypothesis.schema.json').read_text()))\nprint('Updated and validated hypothesis')\nPY\"", "aggregated_output": "Updated and validated hypothesis\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
