{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_46","type":"agent_message","text":"The operand-mux rewrite also missed the threshold. I’m checking whether all four multiply operations can share one combinational multiplier. That would remove duplicated hardware while avoiding the extra multiply cycles that hurt the previous blocking design."}}
