weakly-taken reset, and pre-edge lookup.\nEach entry has a constant six-bit comparison to train_index and locally\ncomputes its next state. Leave fetch prediction, PC control, target\narithmetic, and every module interface unchanged.\n'''},\n {'file':'test/test_pipeline.py','description':'''Preserve existing pipeline and prediction assertions. Add a focused\ntraining sequence that exercises all 64 rows, saturates each direction,\ninterleaves same-index opposite-outcome branches, and holds a resolving\nbranch behind dmem backpressure. Compare observed predictions with the\noriginal two-bit state machine and assert exactly-once training, correct\nreset, unchanged recovery timing, and absence of wrong-path side effects.\n'''}]}\np.write_text(yaml.safe_dump(d,sort_keys=False,width=85))\njsonschema.validate(d,json.loads(Path('schemas/hypothesis.schema.json').read_text()))\nprint('Updated hypothesis; schema valid')\nPY\"", "aggregated_output": "Updated hypothesis; schema valid\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
