actual Gowin mapping and all normal placement options. Acceptance requires more than 168.62566 iterations/s, corresponding to approximately 67.069 MHz if the current 3,977,318 bracketed cycles remain unchanged; use measured cycles and median Fmax, not the fastest placement.''',\n'expected_impact':{'fitness_delta_pct':8,'confidence':'medium'},\n'changes':[\n {'file':'rtl/divider.sv','description':'Replace the seven full-width trial subtractions in each of the two radix-8 steps with a local exact grouped-borrow-prefix helper. Use small unsigned slices, balanced prefix group generate/propagate, one local result subtraction per slice and the exact final borrow. Preserve every arithmetic width, divisor multiple, digit selection, state, handshake and ALTOPS schedule.'},\n {'file':'test/test_alu.py','description':'Retain all existing assertions and latency checks. Add directed and deterministic randomized real DIV/DIVU/REM/REMU vectors exercising borrow propagation across every slice boundary, high divisor multiples, quotient digits 0 through 7, all signed quadrants, zero divisors and overflow. Retain capture, held completion and reset checks. Establish independent arbitrary-input equivalence of the helper to widened unsigned subtraction as additional validation; do not rely on ALTOPS for real arithmetic.'}\n]}\np.parent.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True)\np.write_text(yaml.safe_dump(d,sort_keys=False,width=86))\njsonschema.validate(yaml.safe_load(p.read_text()),json.loads(Path('schemas/hypothesis.schema.json').read_text()))\nprint('Wrote and schema-validated',p)\nPY\"", "aggregated_output": "Wrote and schema-validated cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20261002-001-r10s0.yaml\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
