{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_64","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport yaml,json,jsonschema\np=Path('cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20261002-001-r11s0.yaml')\nd=yaml.safe_load(p.read_text())\nd['hypothesis']=d['hypothesis'].replace('and every test assertion and formal bound unchanged.','and every architectural correctness assertion and formal bound unchanged.')\nd['hypothesis']+='''\\\\n\\\\nThe existing multiply_radix32_forwarding_and_transaction_order test compares the complete internal EX/MEM bubble bundle to zero. Adapt this representation-specific expectation to the new exact bundle value: at an unstalled M wait edge record the unused ALU candidate, then on the next observation require the entire bundle to equal that candidate placed only in alu_result, with every other bit zero. EX/MEM packs pc then alu_result, so the candidate shift is bundle_width-64. M wait instructions cannot be jumps. Do not simply mask off the changed payload or drop the assertion. Preserve all launch/transfer timing, source-value, store-count, prediction, retirement and trace checks. This changes an internal payload expectation while retaining a complete exact-state check and all architectural bubble guarantees.'''\nd['changes'][-1]['description']+=' Replace the representation-specific complete-bubble-equals-zero check with exact equality to the prior-edge unused ALU candidate in the alu_result field and zero in every other field. Retain all architectural, memory, RVFI, launch/transfer and timing checks; do not merely ignore the payload.'\nclass BlockDumper(yaml.SafeDumper): pass\nBlockDumper.add_representer(str,lambda dump,s:dump.represent_scalar('tag:yaml.org,2002:str',s,style='|' if '\\\\n' in s else None))\np.write_text(yaml.dump(d,Dumper=BlockDumper,sort_keys=False,width=90))\njsonschema.validate(yaml.safe_load(p.read_text()),json.load(open('schemas/hypothesis.schema.json')))\nprint('Schema validation passed')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
