{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_59","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport yaml,json,jsonschema\np=Path('cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20261002-001-r14s0.yaml')\nd=yaml.safe_load(p.read_text())\na='Expect about six percent higher fitness if removing the late predicate selection shortens the limiting recovery path enough. This is a low-confidence estimate until all Gowin placement options are measured; forwarding, ALU and divider paths are competing limits, and mode gating at every leaf can add fanout. At unchanged cycles, acceptance requires more than 221.24992 iterations/s, or approximately 88.26852 MHz median. Do not claim acceptance from a single placement or from circuit-equivalent synthesis changes.'\nb='''A disposable prototype of precisely this comparator measured placement options 0/1/2 at 83.122/84.473/84.473 MHz, median 84.473 MHz, versus the champion's 84.388 MHz. It uses 5,781 logic cells, 1,256 registers, 49 LUT-RAMs, four BSRAMs and two DSPs. Canonical stalled CoreMark passes the unchanged CRC/UART/bounds/completion/marker validator in exactly 3,989,539 bracketed cycles. This projects 211.736005 iterations/s, about 0.102 percent above the rounded 211.52 champion. The required integer impact estimate rounds to zero. It does NOT meet the 4.6 percent acceptance margin: that requires more than 221.24992 iterations/s, or approximately 88.26852 MHz. This is the strongest measured local micro-optimization in this proposal session, not an above-threshold candidate. Competing forwarding, ALU and divider paths limit the gain.\n\nBoth existing pipeline-test variants passed all 37 cocotb tests each without assertion changes. Stalled selftest reference cosimulation passed. An exhaustive Yosys SAT miter using the actual replacement expressions proved equality with the original six branch predicates for every operand pair and all eight branch-op encodings. These results establish local correctness and observed performance, not completed orchestrator acceptance. The implementation must still reproduce the result and pass every unchanged gate. A probe that additionally changed recovery qualification and saved prediction polarity reached only 81.220 MHz in options 1/2 and is explicitly excluded.'''\nassert a in d['hypothesis'];d['hypothesis']=d['hypothesis'].replace(a,b)\nd['expected_impact']={'fitness_delta_pct':0,'confidence':'medium'}\nclass D(yaml.SafeDumper): pass\ndef string(dumper,value):\n return dumper.represent_scalar('tag:yaml.org,2002:str',value,style='|' if '\\\\n' in value else None)\nD.add_representer(str,string)\np.write_text(yaml.dump(d,Dumper=D,sort_keys=False,width=88))\njsonschema.validate(yaml.safe_load(p.read_text()),json.loads(Path('schemas/hypothesis.schema.json').read_text()))\nassert d['id']=='hyp-20261002-001-r14s0' and d['category']=='micro_opt'\nprint('Final measured hypothesis is schema-valid:',p)\nprint('Projected fitness',84.473e6*10/3989539)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
