is mandatory.\n'\"'''},\n{'file':'rtl/if_stage.sv','description':'''Remove redirect qualification only from the unreset queue payload RAM\nwrite enable. Keep \"'!reset && enqueue and retain redirect priority for\nPC, count and both pointers. Document recovery-edge writes as discarded\nstorage whose validity is determined solely by count/pointers.\n'\"'''},\n{'file':'test/test_pipeline.py','description':'''Preserve all existing assertions and add recovery cases with empty,\npartial, full and wrapped FIFOs, including enqueue/pop on the redirect\nedge, unavailable fetch and prolonged independent data stalls. Place\nraw loads, stores, MUL/DIV and jumps in discarded or unavailable words;\ncheck that invalid ID/EX controls are zero and that no request, training,\nregister write, side effect or retirement escapes. Verify held live\ninstructions preserve every field, and recovery exposes the target on\nthe original cycle with correct RVFI operands, PCs and contiguous order.\nDo not require invalid payload fields themselves to be zero.\n'''}]}\nclass D(yaml.SafeDumper): pass\ndef represent(dumper,data):\n return dumper.represent_scalar('tag:yaml.org,2002:str',data,style='|' if '\\\\n' in data else None)\nD.add_representer(str,represent)\np.write_text(yaml.dump(d,Dumper=D,sort_keys=False,width=88))\njsonschema.validate(yaml.safe_load(p.read_text()),json.load(open('schemas/hypothesis.schema.json')))\nprint('Revised structural hypothesis written and schema validated.')\nPY\"", "aggregated_output": "Revised structural hypothesis written and schema validated.\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
