e signed operands to unsigned magnitudes, and reuse an\\neight-step radix-2 restoring divide datapath for four iteration clocks.\\nEach step shifts the partial remainder and quotient/dividend and uses\\none 33-bit trial subtraction to select the next remainder and quotient\\nbit. Register normalization before iteration and register\n…[184238 of 187310 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:d54f8fe3760926fe]…\nhanged.\\n\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 188.43, \"delta_pct\": 1.51, \"vs_baseline\": 1454.7, \"fmax_mhz\": 75.175, \"ipc_coremark\": 3e-06, \"cycles\": 3989539, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 5749, \"ff\": 1453, \"seeds\": [70.696, 75.175, 75.175], \"perturbations\": [[0, 70.696, 16], [1, 75.175, 14], [2, 75.175, 14]], \"lutram\": 49, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_mem/reg_q.read_data_2_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_if/count_0_s2\", \"slack_ns\": -9.145, \"arrival_ns\": 19.439, \"logic_cells\": 41, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_wb\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_if\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 16, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-02T01:21:04.824897Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 11, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-10-02 hyp-20261002-003-r11s2 (regression, +1.51%): Unconditionally registering recovery candidates and narrowing squash to controls leaves WB-to-EX ALU and redirect-to-IF-queue-count paths critical, limiting median Fmax to 75.175 MHz at unchanged CoreMark cycles.\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
