rded operands and operation\\nonce, normalize signed operands to unsigned magnitudes, and reuse an\\neight-step radix-2 restoring divide datapath for four iteration clocks.\\nEach step shifts the partial remainder and quotient/dividend and uses\\none 33-bit trial subtraction to select the next remainder and quotient\\nbit. Register normalization before iteration and register\n…[238341 of 241413 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:8e9cd345c4830945]…\n7, \"delta_pct\": 5.32, \"vs_baseline\": 1629.95, \"fmax_mhz\": 83.648, \"ipc_coremark\": 3e-06, \"cycles\": 3989539, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 6211, \"ff\": 1324, \"seeds\": [79.416, 83.648, 83.648], \"perturbations\": [[0, 79.416, 12], [1, 83.648, 11], [2, 83.648, 11]], \"lutram\": 49, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_fwd/rs1_ex_match_q_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_ex/reg_q.alu_result_17_s0\", \"slack_ns\": -7.592, \"arrival_ns\": 17.886, \"logic_cells\": 12, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\", \"cpu/u_ex\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 12, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-02T02:42:25.784513Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 13, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-10-02 hyp-20261002-003-r13s2 (regression, +5.32%): Moving branch forwarding selection to one-bit results of seven balanced comparators and predecoding mismatch polarity removes mux-before-compare delay at unchanged CoreMark cycles, but its +5.32% gain trails joint branch/multiplier predecode (+6.25%).\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
