{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_55","type":"agent_message","text":"The recovery redesign restores the original CoreMark cycle count and passes all 53 formal checks, but its timing still trails the champion. I’m checking a smaller divider next: halve the radix-32 trial bank, trading one extra divide cycle for less area and routing pressure on EX."}}
