{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_26","type":"agent_message","text":"The first probe kept CoreMark cycles unchanged, but median Fmax fell to 69.09 MHz. Recovery fanout still dominates timing. I’m revising the hypothesis to shorten the branch comparison itself with a balanced comparison tree, without adding pipeline state or recovery latency."}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_27","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"python - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport subprocess\nfor f in ['core_pkg.sv','id_stage.sv','ex_stage.sv']:\n p=Path('cores/bench/rtl')/f\n p.write_bytes(subprocess.check_output(['git','show','HEAD:'+str(p)]))\np=Path('cores/bench/rtl/ex_stage.sv')\ns=p.read_text()\ns=s.replace('  always_comb begin\\\\n    case (in.ctrl.branch_op)', '''  logic [3:0] branch_eq_chunk, branch_lt_chunk;\n  logic branch_equal, branch_ult, branch_slt;\n  for (genvar b = 0; b < 4; b++) begin : branch_compare_chunks\n    assign branch_eq_chunk[b] = rs1[b*8 +: 8] == rs2[b*8 +: 8];\n    assign branch_lt_chunk[b] = rs1[b*8 +: 8] < rs2[b*8 +: 8];\n  end\n  logic branch_eq_hi, branch_eq_lo, branch_lt_hi, branch_lt_lo;\n  assign branch_eq_hi = branch_eq_chunk[3] && branch_eq_chunk[2];\n  assign branch_eq_lo = branch_eq_chunk[1] && branch_eq_chunk[0];\n  assign branch_lt_hi = branch_lt_chunk[3] || (branch_eq_chunk[3] && branch_lt_chunk[2]);\n  assign branch_lt_lo = branch_lt_chunk[1] || (branch_eq_chunk[1] && branch_lt_chunk[0]);\n  assign branch_equal = branch_eq_hi && branch_eq_lo;\n  assign branch_ult = branch_lt_hi || (branch_eq_hi && branch_lt_lo);\n  assign branch_slt = (rs1[31] \"'!= rs2[31]) ? rs1[31] : branch_ult;\n\n  always_comb begin\n    case (in.ctrl.branch_op)'\"''')\ns=s.replace('(rs1 == rs2)','branch_equal').replace('(rs1 \"'!= rs2)'\"','\"'!branch_equal'\"').replace('(\"'$signed(rs1) <  $signed(rs2))'\"','branch_slt').replace('(\"'$signed(rs1) >= $signed(rs2))'\"','\"'!branch_slt'\"').replace('(rs1 <  rs2)','branch_ult').replace('(rs1 >= rs2)','\"'!branch_ult'\"')\np.write_text(s)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
