st formal suite including liveness, unique, reg, pc_fwd and pc_bwd, stalled reference cosimulation and canonical CoreMark CRC/UART/bounds/marker checks. Inspect vendor timing specifically for absence of correction in forwarding-match register input cones.''',\n'expected_impact':{'fitness_delta_pct':6,'confidence':'low'},\n'changes':[\n{'file':'rtl/core_pkg.sv','description':'Extend EX/MEM with original prediction, captured branch predicates, two final load-repair flags and unambiguous saved jump/direct targets. Preserve all architectural fields and the IF packet layout.'},\n{'file':'rtl/ex_stage.sv','description':'Prepare control-transfer packets and fault-safe branch operands. Capture deferred load repair only after matching the immediately older load and checking its final write eligibility. Remove EX verification/recovery/training. On older MEM correction, hold the resolving EX/MEM packet and suppress every younger arithmetic request and capture.'},\n{'file':'rtl/mem_stage.sv','description':'Expose the current load final write eligibility to EX. Repair branch operands using only saved flags and registered WB data; resolve all control transfers and RVFI PCs/traps here. Implement sole MEM correction, recovery_applied_q, retained-WB first-edge suppression, and exactly-once final advancement/training.'},\n{'file':'rtl/hazard_unit.sv','description':'Exempt only legal conditional-branch heads from the ordinary load-use bubble. Produce ordinary forwarding controls independently of MEM correction and distinct physical pipeline hold/flush controls with correction priority.'},\n{'file':'rtl/id_stage.sv','description':'Ensure older MEM correction clears the whole ID/EX packet before any younger data/execution hold can retain it. Preserve normal capture, reset and non-recovery stall behavior.'},\n{'file':'rtl/forward_unit.sv','description':'Define and consume only ordinary advancement/hold controls for metadata lookahead; exclude recovery and its derived kill/hold signals fr