{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_32","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"python - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20261002-003-r8s2.yaml')\ns=p.read_text().replace('  Initialize all entries to weakly taken (2\\\\'b10) in a synthesizable initial\\\\n  loop, and preserve them across runtime reset. Writes occur only for\\\\n  \"'!reset && train_valid; the RAM must have no reset or clearing sweep.'\"','  Leave the counter RAM unreset and uninitialized. Reset a separate 64-bit\\\\n  trained bitmap; an untrained fetch index reads weakly taken (2\\\\'b10).\\\\n  On accepted training, write its counter and set its trained bit together.\\\\n  Writes occur only for \"'!reset && train_valid; the RAM has no reset or sweep.'\"')\ns=s.replace('  confirm the vendor mapping. Configuration initialization must agree in\\\\n  simulation, formal and hardware; runtime reset still resets architectural\\\\n  state, fetch PC, queue occupancy, pipeline validity, divider and RVFI order.','  confirm the vendor mapping. Mask uninitialized RAM with the trained bit\\\\n  in simulation, formal and hardware. Runtime reset restores weakly-taken\\\\n  predictions and resets architectural state, fetch PC, queue occupancy,\\\\n  pipeline validity, divider and RVFI order exactly as before.')\ns=s.replace('  Update the YOSYS-only packed-vector queue declaration to \"'$bits(if_id_t)'\"\\\\n  so the enlarged packet is not silently truncated. Hold the snapshot','  Update the YOSYS-only packed-vector queue declaration from 66 to 68 bits\\\\n  so the enlarged packet is not silently truncated. Use an explicit width:\\\\n  this Yosys frontend rejects \"'$bits applied to the typedef. Hold the snapshot'\"')\ns=s.replace('  Adapt the predictor reference model to snapshot training and retained\\\\n  history across runtime reset without dropping architectural assertions.','  Adapt the predictor reference model to snapshot training and the enlarged\\\\n  packet without dropping architectural assertions or reset checks.')\ns=s.replace('      Infer a single-fetch-read distributed 64x2 RAM with configuration-time\\\\n      weakly-taken initialization and reset-gated direct training writes.','      Infer an uninitialized single-fetch-read distributed 64x2 RAM with\\\\n      reset-gated direct training writes and a resettable trained bitmap\\\\n      that selects weakly-taken state until the first update at each index.')\ns=s.replace('      size the YOSYS queue vector from \"'$bits(if_id_t). Preserve queue controls,'\"','      size the YOSYS queue vector explicitly to 68 bits. Preserve queue controls,')\ns=s.replace('      Model packet snapshots, pre-edge reads, snapshot saturation and\\\\n      predictor history retention across runtime reset. Preserve all','      Model packet snapshots, pre-edge reads, snapshot saturation and\\\\n      weakly-taken lookup after reset until training. Preserve all')\np.write_text(s)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
